<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58115" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνεφ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Ra.</u>
			1350
		</span></i> (lyr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dark</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταρτάρου βάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					1029
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				593
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in the dark</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐλθών</span>
			having come <i>in the dark</i>, i.e. <i>at nightfall</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippon.
				63
			</span></i>; also, <i>early in the morning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεφάνη κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					124
				</span></i>
			, cf. <u>Ra.</u> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				327
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
